<Text>&lt;DIV style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; TEXT-ALIGN: center; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 1.0pt 0in&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;LTE-Advanced Downlink Carrier Aggregation Generation&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue&amp;nbsp;Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;This example is to generate LTE-Advanced downlink signals with carrier aggregation.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;The frequency band(center frequency),&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;bandwidth of the component carrier, oversampling ratio and the number of Tx antennas can be chagned in the parameter tab.&lt;BR style=&quot;mso-special-character: line-break&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;2x20MHz_CCs_40MHz&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;BLOCKQUOTE style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=ltr&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;This folder includes schematic to generate 40MHz LTE-Advanced carrier aggregation (two 20MHz component carriers). Enable the&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SignalDownloader_E4438C model and it can be used to download the 40MHz LTE-A DL signal into Keysight ESG/MXG. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BLOCKQUOTE&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; dir=ltr class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;3x20MHz_CCs_60MHz&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;BLOCKQUOTE style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=ltr&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;This folder includes schematic to generate 60MHz LTE-Advanced carrier aggregation (three 20MHz component carriers). Enable the SignalDownloader_E4438C model and it can be used to download the 40MHz LTE-A DL signal into Keysight ESG/MXG. &lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BLOCKQUOTE&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; dir=ltr class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;4x20MHz_CCs_80MHz&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;BLOCKQUOTE style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=ltr&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;This folder includes schematic to generate 80MHz LTE-Advanced carrier aggregation (four 20MHz component carriers). Enable the SignalDownloader_E4438C model and it can be used to download the 40MHz LTE-A DL signal into Keysight ESG/MXG. &lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;The default oversampling ratio is 3. The maximum sampling rate of ESG/MXG is 100MHz, The sampling rate of 80MHz LTE CA signal with 3x upsampling is 30.72MHzx3=92.16MHz.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BLOCKQUOTE&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;5x20MHz_CCs_100MHz&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;BLOCKQUOTE style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=ltr&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;This folder includes schematic to generate 100MHz LTE-Advanced carrier aggregation (five 20MHz component carriers). The default upsampling ratio is 4. The maximum sampling rate of ESG/MXG is 100MHz, The sampling rate of 100MHz LTE CA signal with 4x oversampling is 30.72MHzx4=122.88MHz. This 100MHz LTE-A CA signal (upsampling ratio =4)&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;be downloaded into MXG.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BLOCKQUOTE&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;</Text>
